{"_v":1,"id":"the-book-of-mormon-west-end-2024","bd":{"positive":14,"mixed":7,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Allis Brennan","o":"Evening Standard","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/go/london/theatre/the-book-of-mormon-musical-theatre-tickets-in-london-a3706421.html","d":"2017-11-20","q":"If you believe in a perfect musical, this might just be it."},{"cn":"Steven Suskin","o":"Variety","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"http://variety.com/2011/legit/reviews/the-book-of-mormon-1117944886/","d":"2011-03-24","q":"And that describes “The Book of Mormon,”"},{"cn":"Euan Ferguson","o":"The Guardian","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2013/mar/24/book-of-mormon-review","d":"2013-03-24","q":"The Book of Mormon is far, far cleverer, far kinder, far more nuanced than that, and one of its many surprises is that it sent an enraptured, ecstatic audience home with an odd sense of having come, somehow, to really like Mormons."},{"cn":"Claire Allfree","o":"The Telegraph","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/brigadoon-review-why-did-we-ignore-glorious-classic-musical/","d":"2025-08-12"},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/brigadoon-regent-s-park-open-air-theatre-review-b1242526.html","d":"2025-08-12"},{"cn":"Charles Spencer","o":"The Telegraph","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/culture/theatre/theatre-reviews/9946475/The-Book-of-Mormon-Prince-of-Wales-Theatre-review.html","d":"2013-03-22","q":"And yet, the sneaky truth is that this wild, thrilling, go-for-broke, genuinely hilarious musical comedy remains one of the funniest shows in the West End."},{"cn":"Libby Purves","o":"The Times (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/the-book-of-mormon-prince-of-wales-w1-28gmrq88q5l","d":"2013-03-22","q":"It offers big belting numbers, witty lyrics, and joyfully athletic dances."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/brigadoon-review-a-rare-return-to-scotlands-shangri-la-wdk32388r","d":"2025-08-12"},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2025/aug/12/brigadoon-review-regents-park-open-air-theatre-london","d":"2025-08-12"},{"cn":"Ian Shuttleworth","o":"Financial Times","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/e0a3d0e6-92d9-11e2-b3be-00144feabdc0","d":"2013-03-24","q":"The total creation is neither as perfect nor as audacious as it pretends, but it puts over the package so well that we either do not notice or do not mind."},{"cn":"Fiona Mountford","o":"The i","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://inews.co.uk/culture/brigadoon-musical-great-sparkling-revival-proves-it-3855220?srsltid=AfmBOopKqQcLJRo4zhTWfi-UcT377xxtgL6qWBU0jOW_NldVsojEirUO","d":"2025-08-12"},{"cn":"Paul Taylor","o":"The Independent","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/theatre-review-the-book-of-mormon-merely-flirts-with-blasphemy-but-there-is-something-very-winning-8543751.html","d":"2013-03-21","q":"But there is also something very winning about its spirit."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out London","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/the-book-of-mormon-explained","d":"2015-01-08","q":"The Book of Mormon is a sick mystic revelation, the most exuberantly entertaining Broadway musical in years."},{"cn":"Theo Bosanquet","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://musicaltheatrereview.com/the-book-of-mormon-big-winner-whatsonstage-awards/","d":"2013-03-21","q":"But for me and my generation, reared on South Park and Team America, there is little here to genuinely shock, and laughs by the bucketload."},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/brigadoon-review-dreamy-escapism-in-the-heart-of-regents-park_1690158/","d":"2025-08-12"},{"cn":"Sarah Hemming","o":"Financial Times","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/4444f207-e879-4dda-8dcc-4d70a5c69e36"},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"The Independent","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/brigadoon-regents-park-open-air-theatre-b2805975.html","d":"2025-08-12","q":"Brash, crude, and offensive. A massive hit."},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/brigadoon-review","q":"The asteroid that wiped out the dinosaurs was scarcely more of a hit."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"Metro","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://stagedoor.com/musicals/61-the-book-of-mormon/critic-reviews","q":"Foul-mouthed, funny and wild. Terrifically entertaining."},{"cn":"Oliver Mitford","o":"London Box Office","s":92,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/review-book-of-mormon","d":"2014-02-13","q":"The Book of Mormon not only deals in heaven, but it takes its audience to a comic paradise like no other."},{"cn":"Daniel Perks","o":"London Box Office","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/book-of-mormon-review","d":"2014-06-16","q":"All in all, I can see why the house was full on a Wednesday evening a year after the show opened - a small theatre, exclusive tickets and an incredible cast make this witty, tongue in cheek triumphant musical still one of the hottest spots in town."},{"cn":"Camille Leadbeater","o":"London Box Office","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/the-book-of-mormon-prince-of-wales-theatre-review","d":"2025-03-03","q":"If you are not too easily offended and are willing to leave your sense of morality at the theatre door, you will be entertained."}],"au":{"score":93,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"ss":{"s":91,"c":3301},"mz":{"s":86,"c":3778,"sr":4.3},"sp":{"s":95,"c":5307,"sr":4.76},"lb":{"s":96,"c":5686,"sr":4.8},"ltd":{"s":95,"c":7989,"sr":4.8}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/2cjrziCaxvj1NXO3vdiNv0/e0339325959730a8f42ce47ef2be27f1/The_Book_of_Mormon_-_Hero?fm=webp&q=90"}